+
+## Importing articles
+
+To import articles from a JSON export (a list of `{author, title, description, body, tagList}` objects whose
+`author` is an existing username), run:
+
+```
+python manage.py import_articles path/to/export.json
+```
+
+Rows with a missing field or an unknown author are skipped with a warning.
